      "lines": [
        "runtime/ is read at run time and is not in the shipped file set: lib/Service/MediaSessionService.php:16 reaches it through __DIR__, as 1 further place does.",
        "scripts/ is read at run time and is not in the shipped file set: lib/Service/TranscodeService.php:94 reaches it through __DIR__, as 2 further places do.",
        "  A release ships only the paths of the keep set (the ncmake core and ncmake.mk), so the tarball lacks them and the app fails in the code that reads them, while the build and the packing pass. In ncmake.mk, keep_extra += runtime scripts ships them."
      ]
